'''Florian Himsl''' was one of the two original creators of the original ''The Binding of Isaac'' and its sole programmer.

Florian is represented in-game as the baby of the {{e|Ultra Pride}} mini-boss.

Florian was originally meant to be included in the intro cutscene for Rebirth, but was not, and he remains unused in the files.

